Value Required prefix ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+/\d+)
Value nexthop ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value origin (\S+)
Value local_pref (\d+)
Value med (\d+)
Value as_path (\d+(?:[,\s]+\d+)*)
Value communities (\d+:\d+(?:,\d+:\d+)*)
Value large_communities (\d+:\d+:\d+(?:,\d+:\d+:\d+)*)
Value best (A)
Value description (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Flags:\s+A\s+-\s+active
  ^\s*\d+(?:\s+${best})?\s+peer="${description}"\s+dst-address=${prefix}
  ^\s+nexthop=${nexthop}(?:\s+origin=${origin})?(?:\s+local-pref=${local_pref})?(?:\s+med=${med})?
  ^\s+as-path="${as_path}"
  ^\s+communities=${communities}\s*$$
  ^\s+large-communities=${large_communities}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$ -> Record
